@startuml
title WP-004 Container Aggregate Model

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "Container Aggregate" {
    class Container <<Aggregate Root>>
    class Binding <<Entity>>
    class Alias <<Entity>>
    class ServiceIdentifier <<Value Object>>
    class BindingType <<Value Object>>
    class Lifetime <<Value Object>>
    class BindingMetadata <<Value Object>>
    class ResolutionContext <<Value Object>>
    class ResolutionPath <<Value Object>>
    class ResolutionPolicy <<Value Object>>
}

Container "1" *-- "0..*" Binding : owns
Container "1" *-- "0..*" Alias : owns
Binding "1" *-- "1" ServiceIdentifier : canonical id
Binding "1" *-- "1" BindingType
Binding "1" *-- "1" Lifetime
Binding "1" *-- "1" BindingMetadata
Alias "1" *-- "1" ServiceIdentifier : alias id
Alias "1" --> "1" ServiceIdentifier : canonical target
ResolutionContext "1" *-- "1" ResolutionPath
ResolutionContext "1" *-- "1" ResolutionPolicy

note right of Container
AG-001 One Binding per canonical ServiceIdentifier.
AG-002 Aliases reference existing canonical identifiers.
AG-003 Aliases do not reference themselves.
AG-004 Alias graphs are acyclic.
AG-005 Bindings are immutable.
AG-006 ServiceIdentifier is immutable.
AG-007 Singleton identity is binding-scoped.
AG-008 Resolution paths are acyclic.
AG-009 Container lifetime equals Application lifetime.
end note

@enduml
